{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 5, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a plan for Japan a journey grand\nA sylvan quest across this wondrous land.\n\n**Day One Tokyo's Bright Embrace**\n\nFrom Narita's gate a flight doth start\nTo Tokyo's sprawl a beating heart.\nGinza's gleam and Shibuya's throng\nA vibrant scene where dreams belong.\nThe Imperial Palace a regal sight\nThen Shinjuku's heights bathed in neon light.\n\n**Day Two Ancient Temples' Grace**\n\nTo Asakusa then we swiftly roam\nSenso-ji Temple a sacred home.\nUeno Park with art untold\nMuseums rich with stories old.\nAkihabara's wonders a geeky quest\nElectronics bright put skills to test.\n\n**Day Three Hakone's Mountain View**\n\nHakone calls a mountain's keep\nWhere painted boats on waters sleep.\nMount Fuji's peak a misty dream\nA scenic vista a flowing stream.\nArt museums abound a cultured grace\nNature's beauty in this tranquil place.\n\n**Day Four Kyoto's Golden Hue**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we fly\nWhere ancient temples touch the sky.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling show\nA Zen garden's peace a gentle flow.\nFushimi Inari's gates vermillion bright\nA thousand paths bathed in golden light.\n\n**Day Five Gion's Geisha Dance**\n\nGion district where geishas tread\nA whispered secret softly said.\nTea houses quaint a tranquil scene\nA glimpse of old Japan serene.\nNishiki Market's bounty a taste divine\nLocal flavors truly shine.\n\n**Day Six Nara's Deer Delight**\n\nTo Nara then a gentle pace\nWhere friendly deer fill time and space.\nTodai-ji Temple a giant hall\nHousing Buddha grand enthralling all.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns glow\nA mystical charm a wondrous show.\n\n**Day Seven Osaka's Culinary Feast**\n\nOsaka's streets a foodie's plea\nDotonbori's lights for all to see.\nTakoyaki's warmth and Okonomiyaki's zest\nA culinary journey truly blessed.\nOsaka Castle a historic might\nA final flourish shining bright.\n\n**Day Eight Farewell Japan**\n\nFrom